# Task acceptance via documentation

Implemented work is accepted only after its status is updated in docs.
Code without an updated status is NOT done.

**Canon:** [`docs/products/ERA-Acceptance-Standard.md`](docs/products/ERA-Acceptance-Standard.md)  
**Index:** [`docs/acceptance/README.md`](docs/acceptance/README.md)

